# shape: embedding tutorials: <iframe srcdoc="<p>..."> and fallback markup written between <iframe> and </iframe> (G11: text to a browser, never styled)
kinds=element,attribute,reference,styles,unknown
@@@ file: src/index.html
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head><link rel="stylesheet" href="s.css"></head>
<body>
  <iframe srcdoc="<p class='inner'>hello</p>" title="a"></iframe>
  <iframe src="other.html"><p class="fallback"><a href="https://example.org/">fallback</a></p></iframe>
</body>
</html
@@@ file: src/other.html
<!doctype html><title>o</title>
@@@ file: src/s.css
.fallback a { a: 1 }
iframe { a: 2 }
